        "description": "Compute! Issue 136 - December 1991. 25 top children's programs (Kids & Computers) - Alpha Four (data base management system) (Evaluation) - Andrew Tobias' Managing Your Money (Managing Your Money 7.0, software package) (Evaluation) - Castles (computer game) (Evaluation) - Champions (computer game) (Evaluation) - Christmas wish lists (computer-related gifts) - Color video on the run (color liquid-crystal-display laptop computers) (Column) - Compton's MultiMedia Encyclopedia (Evaluation) - COMPUTE/NET: interactive information (interactive computer system) (Column) - Cumulus GLC (desktop computer) (Evaluation) - Cyberpunk (Cyberpunk: Outlaws and Hackers on the Computer Frontier, authors Katie Hafner and John Markhoff)(column) (Interview) - Demoniak (computer game) (Evaluation) - Designasaurus version II (computer game) (Evaluation) - Editorial license (history of personal computers) (Editorial) - Express Publisher (Express Publisher 2.0, desktop publishing software) (Evaluation) - Extend Visual Basic four ways (Microsoft Visual Basic)(column) (Evaluation) - FaxBuilder (computer graphics software) (Evaluation) - Files under pressure (compressed files) (Column) - Harvard Draw (illustration-design software) (Evaluation) - Heart of China (computer game)(column) (Evaluation) - How to grade a school's use of computers (Kids & Computers) - How to start your child with computers (Kids & Computers) - How to start your child with programming (Kids & Computers) - HP 95LX (palmtop computer) (Evaluation) - Kids & computers glossary (Kids & Computers) (Glossary) - Made to order (Microsoft MS-DOS 5.0 Upgrade as a gift)(column) (Evaluation) - Martian Dreams (Ultima Worlds of Adventure 2 - Martian Dreams computer game) (Evaluation) - Microsoft Flight Simulator Aircraft and Scenery Designer (Evaluation) - Object lessons (programming object-oriented versions of Turbo Pascal) (Column) - Peace on earth (computers' role in social issues) - Remote-control software (Column) - RightWriter (spelling and grammar checker) (Evaluation) - Synthetic stars (computer-generated special effects) (Column) - Telecommunications power (includes related articles) - Test lab (mail-order hard disk drives)(includes related articles) (Evaluation) - The artificial artist (personal computers)(includes related article) - The Bugs Bunny Cartoon Workshop (animation software) (Evaluation) - The incredible expanding RAM (Column) - The infinite crescendo (electronic music)(includes related article) - The Ultimate Computer Software Buyer's Guide (software package) (Evaluation) - Ventura or PageMaker? (Ventura Publisher 3.0 for Windows, PageMaker 4.0)(column) (Evaluation) - Visual Basic (Microsoft Visual Basic)(column) (Evaluation) - Why your child should be using a computer (Kids & Computers) - You're as good as there (remote-control software) - ZOOM/FaxMODEM FC 9624 (fax/modem board) (Evaluation)",
